msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid ""
"Learn to use the mousewheel or the zoom / pinch gesture to zoom in and out."
msgstr "Saznaj kako koristit kotačić za povećavanje i smanjivanje."

#: activities/mining/ActivityInfo.qml:30
